<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46493" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sūgillātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		sugillo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a blackand-blue mark</i>, <i>a livid
				spot</i> (made by a blow, bruise, etc.; not ante-Aug.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sugillationem rapere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					32, 7, 24, § 74</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>an affronting</i>,
				<i>insulting</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">consulum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					43, 14, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">domini,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 47, 10, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">foeda majestatis ejus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					7, 45, 46, § 150</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ipsius gloriae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 2, 3, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amara,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					6, 9, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">admonitionis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ben. 5, 22, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
